OL,3,GNEWSASmugglers who hid migrants in car
OL,4,Aboots jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people smugglers who hid migrants
OL,7,Fin the boots of hired cars in an
OL,8,Fattempt to get them into the UK have
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FFousseynou Soumare and Ange Clavery,
OL,12,Ffrom France, concealed two Vietnamese
OL,13,Fnationals in the vehicles as they tried
OL,14,Fto pass through Poole Port from
OL,15,FCherbourg.
OL,17,FBorder Force officers discovered two
OL,18,Flarge holdall bags in the rear of each
OL,19,Fof the cars, which were being used to
OL,20,Fhide the migrants.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
