OL,3,GNEWSASmugglers who hid migrants in car
OL,4,Aboots jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair, both aged 20, plead guilty to
OL,7,Fassisting unlawful immigration into the
OL,8,FUK. Soumare was jailed for 22 months at
OL,9,FBournemouth Crown Court on 10 July,
OL,10,Fwhile Clavery was given a 24-month term
OL,11,Fon 14 August.
